claim.claim-text:
while monitoring for a sync signal from the master sensor controller, receiving (305) and storing, by a non-master sensor controller of the plurality of sensor controllers (112b, 114b, 116b), one or more input samples from a corresponding sensor;
upon receiving the sync signal from the master sensor controller, computing, by the non-master sensor controller, a sample output from the one or more input samples received while monitoring for the sync signal; and
outputting, by the non-master sensor controller, the sample output generated from the one or more input samples received while monitoring for the sync signal from the master sensor controller.

